# Skill: Anthropic Agent Skills Spec

Purpose:
  Specification for Anthropic agent skills format. Defines the structure,
  metadata, and conventions for creating portable, executable skills.

Owns: ./

ReadOrder:
   1  @INDEX.sdd
   2  @agent-skills-spec.md

Modes:
  APPLY    — apply spec to current skill design
  REVIEW   — review skill against spec
  CREATE   — create new skill following spec

Rules:
  [AS1] Skills MUST declare frontmatter: name, description, version.
  [AS2] Skills MUST be executable contracts with input/output.
  [AS3] Skills MUST NOT rely on hidden context.

Entry:
  Read:
    INDEX.sdd
    agent-skills-spec.md

Navigation:
  Spec: @INDEX.sdd
  AgentSkillsSpec: @agent-skills-spec.md

State: +